<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 332 &amp; 77-1 V INDIA (375) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 332 &amp; 77-1 V INDIA (375) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, 43 behind India on first innings, were 77-1 in their second innings at the close on the third day of the second and final test on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 332 and 77-1, India 375.</p>
</text>
